# spec: request directives land in `extra` keyed by @name
### no-redirect
# @no-redirect
GET https://example.com/redirects
### no-cookie-jar
# @no-cookie-jar
GET https://example.com/session
### timeout
# @timeout 600
GET https://example.com/slow
### several
# @no-log
# @no-auto-encoding
# @connection-timeout 2 m
# @timeout 30 s
GET https://example.com/many
